      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SITE1 → n8n notifications starter\n\nEach Webhook node below receives a SITE1 event. The **Parse payload** node turns the text/plain JSON body into fields. The grey **→ …** nodes are placeholders — replace each with a real action (Gmail / Email / Slack / Telegram / Twilio).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import this workflow.\n2. Set Vercel env `VITE_WEBHOOK_BASE` = `https://YOUR-N8N-HOST/webhook` (no trailing slash), redeploy SITE1.\n3. **Activate** this workflow (toggle top-right) so the webhook URLs go live.\n4. No CORS config needed — SITE1 sends CORS-simple requests.\n\nFull event list + payloads: SITE1_DATA_DICTIONARY.md → \"Outbound webhook events\".",
